data: {"id": "16ebd2ef05d245b7-thinking-parallel_evidence-544", "run_id": "16ebd2ef05d245b7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已获得关键事实：\n\n**已确认事实：**\n1. Pod 当前状态：**Pending / ContainerCreating**（非 Running）\n2. **Node**: node2/10.2.0.50\n3. **关键 Events**: `NoNetworkFound` from multus — `'network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io unavailable-network not found' in namespace aiops-case-05`\n4. **Annotation**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` — 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition\n5. **FailedCreatePodSandBox** 事件重复出现（26m-29m 时间窗内）\n6. **Metrics**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerC", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788429728956, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

